Z||000004||DXR_DAD||03-14-2000||10:30 PM||||Big O you out there??  are you getting things together for us FieroNs. Hows the detail job coming? ||||reg||1
Z||000005||Big O||03-14-2000||11:09 PM||||Things are warming up.  Unfortunately so is the business.  The good weather is bringing the customers out of the woodwork and things have been hopping.  The show is right on track and I will be putting a piece in the Modesto Bee to get some local attention.  I hope it will bring in some extra cars.  I've seen some really nice Fieros in Modesto and the outlying regions.  I'm sure if they had a chance to get organized we could have a great time.  the weather this weekend should be great with predictions in the mid-70s.  Come on out to the 1st annual Big O Tires Springtime Show and Shine Car Show!!||||reg||1
