Z||000007||mshill||03-16-2000||05:16 PM||||I am disappointed that I will not be able to attend.  I have a little league practice from 10am until 1pm and wouldn't get on the road until about 2pm.  I think Modesto is about an hour drive so I wouldn't get there until 3pm when it is over.<P>The other issue is that my car isn't exactly back together.  My engine is in and I did the old 30 minute run-in yesterday, but it doesn't have any rear brakes or rear wheels on it as yet.  I also have a bunch of small stuff to do that I don't want to rush (brakes, bleed clutch, replace drivers side seat cover, cat back exhaust).  All of this stuff could be done tomorrow if I take the day off, but again I don't want to screw it up.<P>When done I will just have to post some pictures instead of being at the show.||||reg||9
